<title>USA: Commerce, Eldorado agree to merger.</title>
<headline>Commerce, Eldorado agree to merger.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Security Bancorp Inc and Eldorado Bancorp said they agreed that Commerce Security will acquire 100 percent of the outstanding stock of Eldorado for $23 per share cash.</p>
<p>Eldorado Bank had total assets of about $390 million at September 30. Commerce Security currently owns three banks with total assets of about $440 million at September 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
